# U62 — Deprecation / retirement clock
Priority: P0 (dated). Size: S. Depends on: U61.

Facts (release notes): Claude Sonnet 4.5 `claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929` deprecated 2026-09-30, retirement on the Claude API 2026-11-30; recommended target Claude Sonnet 5.5. Already retired: Opus 4.1 (2026-08-05), Sonnet 4 and Opus 4 (2026-06-15), Haiku 3 (2026-04-20), Sonnet 3.7 and Haiku 3.5 on the API (2026-02-19), Opus 3 (2026-01-05), Sonnet 3.5 (2025-10-28). Legacy Workbench and the experimental prompt-tools endpoints were retired 2026-08-17.

Requirements:
- add Sonnet 4.5 (dated ID AND the alias form used in the catalog) to the DEPRECATED_MODELS registry with the 2026-11-30 date and Sonnet 5.5 as migration target; wire into `--model-info`, `--check-deprecated`, `--upgrade-all`.
- verify RETIRED_MODELS against the live Model deprecations page; add anything missing; keep retired IDs out of selectable defaults.
- `--upgrade-all` must show a countdown and refuse silent behavior change (dry-run default stays).
- remove or error-guard code paths that call the retired experimental prompt-tools endpoints, if present.
- tests: date-driven behavior with an injected clock (no wall-clock dependence).
